flowchart TD
  P0[planning: walk the tree] --> P1{row in shrink database<br/>same file name?}
  P1 -- yes --> S[skip - database has precedence]
  P1 -- no --> P2{recorded as failed,<br/>same size?}
  P2 -- "yes, no --retry-failed" --> FB[left out<br/>listed as FAILED BEFORE]
  P2 -- no --> A[planned video]
  A --> X{stop requested?<br/>mediatools stop / Ctrl+C}
  X -- yes --> END[close result table, summary, exit 1]
  X -- no --> C{video stream<br/>already HEVC?}
  C -- yes --> R1[record in DB, no re-encode<br/>row: HEVC]
  C -- no --> TD{trial decode of the first 10 s:<br/>10 or more decoder errors?}
  TD -- yes --> BR[not encoded, original kept<br/>failure noted; row: BROKEN]
  TD -- no --> E[ffmpeg libx265 at nice 19<br/>into newShrinkedFiles/]
  E --> V{exit 0, output at least 2 %,<br/>video stream, duration matches,<br/>output decodes?}
  V -- no --> F[original kept, failure noted,<br/>ffmpeg messages kept in logs/ffmpeg/<br/>row: FAILED, continue]
  V -- yes --> K{--keep-copies?}
  K -- yes --> KC[keep copy, record nothing<br/>row: copy]
  K -- no --> W[ReplaceJournal: copy into the original inode<br/>+ record; row: shrunk]
